d 'FEVC': module for leave-out bias-corrected variance decompositions
d
d    fevc implements the leave-out bias correction of Kline,
d Saggio, and Sølvsten for worker-firm fixed-effects models. It
d estimates the variances of worker and firm effects, their
d covariance, and the variance of their sum, with support for
d controls, weights, and match or observation deletion. It provides
d exact and randomized calculations, numerical Monte Carlo standard
d errors, and supported projection and experimental component
d inference. A source-only Mata backend and an optional parallel
d Rust backend share the same Stata interface. 
d
d KW: leave-out variance decomposition
d KW: bias correctionm
d
d Requires: Stata version 18
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261018
d
d Author: Johannes Schmieder,  Boston University
d Support: email johannes@@bu.edu
d
